Icons in this folder never follow the chosen pack.

The window control glyphs (window-close, window-maximize, window-minimize,
window-restore) are part of Sonora and carry the licence in COPYING.

The brand marks (applemusic, deezer, firefoxbrowser, netease, spotify, youtubemusic) come from
Simple Icons (https://simpleicons.org), released under CC0 1.0. Each mark stays the
trademark of its owner and is used only to point at that service.

The middle-scroll anchor (scroll) is part of Sonora and carries the licence in COPYING.
